; c16-two-to-four-doubles. Anchor: shot-0234 (Ch. 16, other statistics).
; Printed: at least 0.36.
; Claim: a random seven-tile hand holds two, three or four doubles.
; State: none; a uniformly random hand of seven from the 28.
; Exact: 683354/1184040 = 341677/592020 = 0.5771. The printed bound holds
;   but is the two-double bucket alone, not the sum.
;
; GAP deal-view (see c16-four-of-a-suit). The query is the event for one
;   known hand: two doubles held, and no five.
(query
  (viewer v)
  (double a)
  (double b)
  (holds v a)
  (holds v b)
  (none (roles c d e)
    (double c)
    (double d)
    (double e)
    (not (tile c a))
    (not (tile c b))
    (not (tile d a))
    (not (tile d b))
    (not (tile e a))
    (not (tile e b))
    (holds v c)
    (holds v d)
    (holds v e)))
